1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,718
Two terms students mix up.

2
00:00:01,718 --> 00:00:06,718
Food safety is about quality: the food must not harm the person eating it.

3
00:00:06,718 --> 00:00:15,755
Food security is about access: all people, at all times, have enough safe and nutritious food for an active, healthy life.

4
00:00:15,755 --> 00:00:22,864
Security stands on four pillars: availability, access, utilisation, and stability.

